namespace Ponca
{
/*!
  \page ponca_ecosystem_page The Ponca ecosystem

  The %Ponca library only provides the core implementation of algorithms for point cloud processing and analysis: it
  does not include any way to visualize the results, nor integrations with other libraries. The %Ponca team develops
  a few tools built on top of the library:

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Name</th>
      <th>Goal</th>
      <th>Teaser</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><a href="https://github.com/poncateam/poncaplot" target="_blank">Poncaplot</a></td>
      <td>Plot 2D scalar fields computed from 2D point clouds</td>
      <td><img width="350" alt="Poncaplot screenshot" src="https://github.com/poncateam/poncaplot/assets/6310221/baddf074-6e32-447d-83aa-21d16fcd8977"/></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><a href="https://github.com/poncateam/poncascope" target="_blank">Poncascope</a></td>
      <td>Visualize 3D point clouds and the estimators of %Ponca</td>
      <td>
        <img width="350" alt="Poncascope screenshot" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/6310221/134543845-2f9094dd-1025-482a-b735-504b9cd8c5cd.png"/>
        <br/><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WRqO93rEy6s" target="_blank">[Video]</a>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><a href="https://github.com/poncateam/ponca-igl" target="_blank">Ponca-igl</a></td>
      <td>3D viewer and integration with <a href="https://libigl.github.io/" target="_blank">libigl</a>, a geometry
      processing library</td>
      <td>Upcoming</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  The library also has a Python binding, documented in \ref pyponca.
 */
} // namespace Ponca
